    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Obulemi bwa MUKAMA obw'obusinge obw'ensi yoona",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Binu nibyo ebigambo, Ruhanga ebi yagambiire Isaaya mutabani w'Amozi, hali Yuda na Yerusaalemu:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weewe enju ya Yakobbo, oije tugendere omukyererezi kya MUKAMA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ai Ruhaga, okanagaija abantu bawe, niyo enju ya Yakobbo, habwokuba baina embandwa nyingi ezaarugire Burugaizooba, baina n'abafumu baingi abarukusisana Abafirisiti, kandi nibaganjana n'abanyamahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi yabo erumu efeeza n'ezaabbu nyingi, obuguuda bubahinguraine; ensi yabo ijwire embaraasi, ebigaali byabo butabarwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensi yabo erumu abadoma baingi; nibaramya ebintu ebi baakozire n'emikono yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki, omuntu abundaazibwa kandi abantu bagarurwa hansi otabaganyira!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kus 6:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2TH.1.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2Bat 1:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Taaha omu mwandara oyesereke omu cuucu, baitu oruge omumaiso ga MUKAMA, oruge omu kitiinisa eky'obukuru bwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaiso g'omuntu ag'emyehembo galiigarwa, okwekuliiriza kw'abantu kulimarwaho hakiro eki, MUKAMA wenka nuwe alinyumizibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habwokuba aina ekiro eky'alibundaalizaaho weena anyakwekuliiriza, na weena anyakwehemba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eky'alihwerekererezaaho emikogoto enyakuraihire yoona eya Lebbanooni n'emihomozi eya Bbasani; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eky'alinganirizaaho ensozi zoona eziraihire, n'obusozi bwona oburaihire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eky'aliihiraho omunaara gwona oguraihire n'ekisiika kyona ekigumire; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eky'aliihiraho meeri zoona Tarasisi, kandi eky'aliihiraho ebintu ebisemereza amaiso g'omuntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okwekuliiriza kw'omuntu kulicwekerezibwa n'emyehembo ye erihwerekerezibwa; ha kiro eki, MUKAMA wenka nuwe alinyumizibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebisisani birihweraho kimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abantu balitaahira amaingira ag'omu myandara n'omu biina eby'omwitaka, baruge omumaiso ga MUKAMA, baruge n'omu kitiinisa eky'obukuru bwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha kiro eki, abantu ebisisani eby'efeeza n'ezaabbu eby'okuramya ebi baayekoliire n'emikono yabo, nubwo balibihungura aheeru babinagire ebihukuzi n'ebihuguhugu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bataahire amaingira ag'emyandara n'omu nyatika ez'amabaale, baruge omumaiso ga MUKAMA, baruge n'omu kitiinisa eky'obukurubwe, obwaliija kutengesa ensi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.2.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
